g and just plays along with whatever she does. Feel free to explore any poses, aesthetics, or ideas that inspire you. Looking forward to seeing your incredible work! Thank you!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1wnw6DOU5h-3fA7UowJVURukwihFr-oxw?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@R_getsul/works/28", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/0aa9a76c/uploads/origins/371ef2fd-b796-4702-a4fe-5b8acf4f9754?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ac0507612fc9f8685a363b109b98df58", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0aa9a76c/uploads/origins/371ef2fd-b796-4702-a4fe-5b8acf4f9754?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ac0507612fc9f8685a363b109b98df58, https://si.imgix.net/0aa9a76c/uploads/origins/371ef2fd-b796-4702-a4fe-5b8acf4f9754?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3441488f0855e18d96f26b379444faed 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0aa9a76c/uploads/origins/371ef2fd-b796-4702-a4fe-5b8acf4f9754?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=918133aea3370c2cbde059461e665558 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "ショタ刃ちゃんとショタ飲月を描いてほしい！！！\nどうしても、どうしても…瓏月さんのショタ刃ちゃんとショタ飲月を吸いたいです\n大まかな構図や表情等はまたお任せしたいのですが、ねこちゃんズも一緒に描いてほしいです!!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@R_getsul/works/27", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c487455c/uploads/origins/48b3bcd1-bdee-4bf8-b72c-97fb2f9ac507?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0f0e22fddb4065f2718031182ff40f72", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c487455c/uploads/origins/48b3bcd1-bdee-4bf8-b72c-97fb2f9ac507?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0f0e22fddb4065f2718031182ff40f72, https://si.imgi